 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "土曜日の交換会ですが、全員に四時から三十分、後始末を頼む案はどうでしょう。分担が公平になると思ったんです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D001-S01",
    "C54-D001-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 9.103,
   "duration_sec": 9.103
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "私は四時から本の店で働くので、三時半に出なければなりません。後始末を手伝えなくても、来ていいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D002-S01",
    "C54-D002-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 9.453,
   "end_sec": 17.125,
   "duration_sec": 7.672
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい、参加できます。手伝いは参加の条件ではありません。案内にそう書くべきですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D003-S01",
    "C54-D003-S02",
    "C54-D003-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 17.475,
   "end_sec": 24.3,
   "duration_sec": 6.825
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "参加する人の立場も考えるべきですね。全員に同じ仕事を頼んでも公平にはなりません。小さな負担も、重なるとばかになりません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D004-S01",
    "C54-D004-S02",
    "C54-D004-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 24.65,
   "end_sec": 34.127,
   "duration_sec": 9.477
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "ただ、四時半までに後始末を終える約束があります。担当者を決めないまま開くわけにはいきません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D005-S01",
    "C54-D005-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 34.477,
   "end_sec": 41.675,
   "duration_sec": 7.198
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "準備の仕事も選べるようにしませんか。別の時間なら手伝える人もいると思います。準備は何時からですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D006-S01",
    "C54-D006-S02",
    "C54-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 42.025,
   "end_sec": 49.45,
   "duration_sec": 7.425
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "一時半から二時までです。本を机に置く仕事です。ミンさんは、その時間なら来られますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D007-S01",
    "C54-D007-S02",
    "C54-D007-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 49.8,
   "end_sec": 56.377,
   "duration_sec": 6.577
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "手伝えないことはないですが、午前中にも予定があります。木曜日までに確認して返事をしてもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D008-S01",
    "C54-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 56.727,
   "end_sec": 63.502,
   "duration_sec": 6.775
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。無理に引き受けることはありません。ミンさんはまだ確認中ですね。佐藤さんはどうですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D009-S01",
    "C54-D009-S02",
    "C54-D009-S03",
    "C54-D009-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 63.852,
   "end_sec": 70.701,
   "duration_sec": 6.849
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "私は後始末を引き受けます。ただ、重い箱を一人で運ぶのは控えたいです。安全に運びたいので。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D010-S01",
    "C54-D010-S02",
    "C54-D010-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 71.051,
   "end_sec": 78.555,
   "duration_sec": 7.504
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "重い箱は二人で運びましょう。人と本を守るために、安全を優先するべきですね。これは必要な条件です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D011-S01",
    "C54-D011-S02",
    "C54-D011-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 78.905,
   "end_sec": 86.991,
   "duration_sec": 8.086
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "出口の前にも箱を置いてはいけません。会議室のルールに書いてありました。その説明もお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D012-S01",
    "C54-D012-S02",
    "C54-D012-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 87.341,
   "end_sec": 94.147,
   "duration_sec": 6.806
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "案内を書く前に、机で紹介する練習帳も確認しましょう。「予鈴が鳴っても、まだ書き始めないでください」という注意がありました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D013-S01",
    "C54-D013-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 94.497,
   "end_sec": 102.884,
   "duration_sec": 8.387
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "本番の試験の注意ですね。この会では自由に試せます。何も本番と同じように時間を測ることはありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D014-S01",
    "C54-D014-S02",
    "C54-D014-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 103.234,
   "end_sec": 111.106,
   "duration_sec": 7.872
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "そうですね。書き間違いを笑う人がいたら、担当者が意見します。失敗した人を責めるより、安心して試せる場を作りたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D015-S01",
    "C54-D015-S02",
    "C54-D015-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 111.456,
   "end_sec": 120.477,
   "duration_sec": 9.021
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "賛成です。ただ、「手伝うべきだ」という助言は命令にも聞こえます。「無理をしないことだ」という忠告をするなら、断れることも伝えましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D016-S01",
    "C54-D016-S02",
    "C54-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 120.827,
   "end_sec": 130.912,
   "duration_sec": 10.085
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "手伝う人の負担も考えたいです。人が少なければ、本を少なくする案はどうでしょう。全員が同じ仕事をする必要はありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D017-S01",
    "C54-D017-S02",
    "C54-D017-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 131.262,
   "end_sec": 140.234,
   "duration_sec": 8.972
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "本を少なくする案なら、妥協できます。でも、安全のための人数を少なくするわけにはいきません。二人も賛成ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D018-S01",
    "C54-D018-S02",
    "C54-D018-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 140.584,
   "end_sec": 149.235,
   "duration_sec": 8.651
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "賛成です。私たちは時間の分担では譲歩できますが、安全の原則は変更できません。この条件を案内に書いてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D019-S01",
    "C54-D019-S02",
    "C54-D019-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 149.585,
   "end_sec": 158.617,
   "duration_sec": 9.032
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C54-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "私も賛成です。今日は三人の合意ですね。ほかの人にも木曜日まで意見を聞いて、金曜日に案を決めましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C54-D020-S01",
    "C54-D020-S02",
    "C54-D020-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 158.967,
   "end_sec": 167.082,
   "duration_sec": 8.115
  }
 ],
 "sentence_intervals": [
