   "end_sec": 49.45,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C54-D007-S01",
   "unit_id": "C54-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "一時半から二時までです。",
   "start_sec": 49.8,
   "end_sec": 51.66,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C54-D007-S02",
   "unit_id": "C54-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "本を机に置く仕事です。",
   "start_sec": 51.81,
   "end_sec": 53.95,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C54-D007-S03",
   "unit_id": "C54-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "ミンさんは、その時間なら来られますか。",
   "start_sec": 54.1,
   "end_sec": 56.377,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C54-D008-S01",
   "unit_id": "C54-D008",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "手伝えないことはないですが、午前中にも予定があります。",
